{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/berryxia/status/2055784649830670829","id":"2055784649830670829","text":"兄弟们，这个网页开发者的个人网站有点牛批啊！\n\nDavid Heckhoff 把自己的 portfolio 彻底重做了一遍，现在直接开源了。\n\n打开就是一整个沉浸式 3D 办公室：卡通版的自己坐在桌前，鼠标一动就能互动，动画、灯光、物理反馈都平滑到极致。\n\n点开 About，角色切换成全息投影，技能列表和项目展示（CubeWar、Sharkie、Quibbo 等）一个个飞出来，最后还带一句 “Let's work together！”站在一堆快递箱前。\n\n全程用 Three.js + GreenSock + Lenis 打造，细节和流畅度拉满。\n\n源码已开源：  \nhttps://github.com/davidhckh/portfolio-2025  \n\n网站在线体验：  \nhttps://david-hckh.com","raw_text":{"text":"兄弟们，这个网页开发者的个人网站有点牛批啊！\n\nDavid Heckhoff 把自己的 portfolio 彻底重做了一遍，现在直接开源了。\n\n打开就是一整个沉浸式 3D 办公室：卡通版的自己坐在桌前，鼠标一动就能互动，动画、灯光、物理反馈都平滑到极致。\n\n点开 About，角色切换成全息投影，技能列表和项目展示（CubeWar、Sharkie、Quibbo 等）一个个飞出来，最后还带一句 “Let's work together！”站在一堆快递箱前。\n\n全程用 Three.js + GreenSock + Lenis 打造，细节和流畅度拉满。\n\n源码已开源：  \nhttps://t.co/9RgrOb65v3  \n\n网站在线体验：  \nhttps://t.co/HjT7qi8XKs","display_text_range":[0,346],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[132,155],"id":"2055784433287061504","display":"pic.x.com/ElJHSSlfip","original":"https://t.co/ElJHSSlfip","replacement":"https://x.com/berryxia/status/2055784649830670829/video/1"},{"type":"url","indices":[286,309],"original":"https://t.co/9RgrOb65v3","replacement":"https://github.com/davidhckh/portfolio-2025","display":"github.com/davidhckh/port…"},{"type":"url","indices":[323,346],"original":"https://t.co/HjT7qi8XKs","replacement":"https://david-hckh.com","display":"david-hckh.com"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"berryxia","url":"https://x.com/berryxia","id":"431617343","followers":53541,"following":773,"likes":7878,"media_count":2178,"name":"Berryxia.AI","description":"Building AI Tools & Vibe Coding\nAI 视频 · 数字人 · 广告内容创作\nLove Design, Coding & Sharing Prompts\n探索 AI 驱动的代码与视觉创造力\n📮:Andyhuo@me.com","raw_description":{"text":"Building AI Tools & Vibe Coding\nAI 视频 · 数字人 · 广告内容创作\nLove Design, Coding & Sharing Prompts\n探索 AI 驱动的代码与视觉创造力\n📮:Andyhuo@me.com","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banne